 "description": "Wait for the user to choose on the pick page. Long-polls up to 50 seconds\u2014returns as soon as\nthey click, or status \"pending\" after the wait (call again if so).\n\nOnce chosen, returns their reference with its screenshot and a full build prompt, so you can\nstart building from it immediately. If they clicked \"None of these fit\", status is \"dismissed\"\nand you should ask what they want instead.",
